# Solver rules

Consult [agent/DATASHEET.md](agent/DATASHEET.md) for PLL equations and limits.

## Output contract

- `solve()` returns `SolveResult` with **fields dict only** — never register words
- Caller merges via `register_file.configure(**result.fields)`
- Encoding always through mapper + register file

## Math

- Integer Hz only (`_round_div`, `_ceil_div`, `_gcd`)
- VCO band: 2.2–4.4 GHz; smallest power-of-two RF divider
- MOD search: minimize |error|, then prefer smaller MOD; gcd-reduce when frac > 0
- Bounds from `ADF435xDeviceProfile` + module constants — no `DeviceLimits` class

## Reference path

Default eval board: R=1, doubler off, div-by-2 off. Overridable via `SolveOptions`.

## Integer-N

When frac == 0: set LDF, ABP=3ns, charge_cancel (ADF4351) per datasheet.

## Errors

Use `{Condition}Error` naming. Do not silently clamp out-of-range frequencies.

## Tests

Golden vector must pass after solver changes. Update [agent/DATASHEET.md](agent/DATASHEET.md) if extracted facts change.
